### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Valid subscribe (use the email you signed up to Resend with)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com" }

### Invalid email -> 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email" }

### Missing email -> 400
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Unknown route -> 404
GET http://localhost:5000/api/nothing
